turnkey-nodebb-19.0 (1) turnkey; urgency=low

  * Initial release of the NodeBB appliance for Keel, compatible with
    TurnKey Linux appliances.

  * NodeBB 4.11.2 installed under /var/www/nodebb from the release tarball,
    pinned by version and sha256 in conf.d/main.

  * Node.js 20, npm, Redis 8 and nginx from Debian 13 (Trixie).

  * nginx in front on [::]:443 and [::]:80, proxying to NodeBB on [::1]:4567;
    Redis bound to ::1 and 127.0.0.1.

  * First boot from the instance spec: firstboot.d/40nodebb runs the
    non-interactive NodeBB setup and creates the admin user from
    APP_DOMAIN, APP_EMAIL and APP_PASS.

 -- Keel Linux maintainers <admin@keellinux.org>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
